the-deeper-rule-d2609183.conceptual_definition:
The Deeper Rule, also known as the anomaly link, describes a fundamental relationship in quantum field theory where a classical conservation law is violated by quantum effects. Specifically, it quantifies the non-conservation of a 'baryon current' (
